'''Pumpkin''' was a [[Default Knife]] skin made by [[didi1147]]. It was designed and published on October 28, 2016, and was most likely meant to be released as part of the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]]. However, due to unknown circumstances, it was scrapped and never made it to the game.

